msgctxt "notification timeout"
msgid "System default"
msgstr "Systeemstandaard"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"System default: as set in System Settings > Notifications. A reminder hidden "
"after a set time isn't kept in the notification history."
msgstr ""
"Systeemstandaard: zoals ingesteld in Systeeminstellingen > Meldingen. Een "
"herinnering die na een vaste tijd wordt verborgen, blijft niet in de "
"meldingengeschiedenis."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Snooze"
msgstr "Sluimeren"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "0 = no Snooze button"
msgstr "0 = geen sluimerknop"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml ../contents/ui/TimerView.qml
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Geluid"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "When an Event Starts"
msgstr "Als een afspraak begint"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Show a notification"
msgstr "Melding tonen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "Kritiek"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Shown even in Do Not Disturb"
msgstr "Ook getoond bij Niet storen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "\"Join meeting\" button"
msgstr "Knop ‘Deelnemen aan vergadering’"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Meetings"
msgstr "Vergaderingen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Open the meeting link when a meeting starts"
msgstr "Vergaderlink openen wanneer een vergadering begint"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "For meetings you accepted or organize, not marked as ended."
msgstr ""
"Voor vergaderingen die je hebt geaccepteerd of organiseert en die niet als "
"afgelopen zijn gemarkeerd."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Pause music and videos when joining a meeting"
msgstr "Muziek en video's pauzeren bij deelname aan een vergadering"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Players that are playing (eg: Spotify, Elisa, a video in the browser), when "
"a Join button opens a meeting or it opens when the meeting starts."
msgstr ""
"Spelers die afspelen (bijv. Spotify, Elisa, een video in de browser), "
"wanneer een Deelnemen-knop een vergadering opent of die opent bij de start."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Do Not Disturb during meetings"
msgstr "Niet storen tijdens vergaderingen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Plasma's Do Not Disturb from the start until the end of a meeting with "
"guests or a meeting link. Mark as Ended turns it off."
msgstr ""
"‘Niet storen’ van Plasma vanaf het begin tot het einde van een vergadering "
"met gasten of een vergaderlink. ‘Markeren als afgelopen’ schakelt het uit."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Only meetings I accepted"
msgstr "Alleen vergaderingen die ik heb geaccepteerd"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Open Google Meet links in"
msgstr "Google Meet-links openen in"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Default browser"
msgstr "Standaardbrowser"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Other command…"
msgstr "Ander commando…"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Commando"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Google account"
msgstr "Google-account"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml ../contents/ui/config/ConfigViews.qml
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standaard"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Join buttons open Google Meet links there; other meeting links open in the "
"default browser. In a command, %u stands for the meeting link. Google "
"account: its number (0, 1, …) or email, as in Google's account switcher; "
"empty uses the app's default."
msgstr ""
"Deelnemen-knoppen openen Google Meet-links daar; andere vergaderlinks openen "
"in de standaardbrowser. In een commando staat %u voor de vergaderlink. "
"Google-account: het nummer (0, 1, …) of e-mailadres, zoals in Googles "
"accountwisselaar; leeg gebruikt de standaard van de app."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Other Notifications"
msgstr "Andere meldingen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "New invitations for today"
msgstr "Nieuwe uitnodigingen voor vandaag"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"A notification for each meeting today you haven't answered yet, with Yes, "
"Maybe and No."
msgstr ""
"Een melding voor elke vergadering van vandaag die je nog niet hebt "
"beantwoord, met Ja, Misschien en Nee."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Today's events every morning"
msgstr "Elke ochtend de afspraken van vandaag"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"A notification with today's events once a day, also when the computer is "
"turned on later."
msgstr ""
"Eén keer per dag een melding met de afspraken van vandaag, ook als de "
"computer later wordt aangezet."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "At"
msgstr "Om"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid "Skip events I declined"
msgstr "Afgewezen afspraken overslaan"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigEvents.qml
msgid ""
"Popups and sounds for each kind of notification can also be set in System "
"Settings > Notifications > Event Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Pop-ups en geluiden per soort melding kunnen ook worden ingesteld in "
"Systeeminstellingen > Meldingen > Event Calendar."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Google Account"
msgstr "Google-account"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigTasks.qml
msgid "Google Account %1"
msgstr "Google-account %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login failed: %1"
msgstr "Inloggen mislukt: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Login complete."
msgstr "Ingelogd."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Could not prepare Google login: %1"
msgstr "Kan Google-login niet voorbereiden: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Waiting for browser callback..."
msgstr "Bezig met wachten op terugkoppeling van webbrowser..."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign-in timed out. Try again."
msgstr "Inloggen duurde te lang. Probeer het opnieuw."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed. See logs for details."
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt. Bekijk de logboeken voor details."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: invalid callback data."
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt: ongeldige terugkoppelingsgegevens."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: %1"
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt: %1"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Auto login failed: authorization code missing."
msgstr "Automatisch inloggen mislukt: autorisatiecode ontbreekt."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"The desktop could not open the browser automatically. Use the login link in "
"Advanced sign-in options instead."
msgstr ""
"De webbrowser kan niet automatisch worden geopend. Gebruik in plaats daarvan "
"de inloglink in Geavanceerde inlogopties."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid ""
"Sign in to show your Google calendars and task lists. Your browser opens to "
"sign in; when access is granted the widget picks it up automatically."
msgstr ""
"Log in om je Google-agenda's en takenlijsten te tonen. Je webbrowser wordt "
"geopend om in te loggen; zodra je toegang verleent, pikt de widget dat "
"automatisch op."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgctxt "%1 = email addresses"
msgid ""
"KDE PIM (Akonadi) already brings in the Google calendars of %1, read-only. "
"Sign in here as well to answer invitations, edit and delete events and join "
"meetings from the widget. Events of an account synced both ways are shown "
"once, from the sign-in here."
msgstr ""
"KDE PIM (Akonadi) haalt de Google-agenda's van %1 al op, alleen-lezen. Meld "
"u ook hier aan om uitnodigingen te beantwoorden, afspraken te bewerken en te "
"verwijderen en vanuit de widget aan vergaderingen deel te nemen. Afspraken "
"van een account die op beide manieren gesynchroniseerd wordt, worden één "
"keer getoond, via de aanmelding hier."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgctxt "%1 = email addresses"
msgid ""
"Also synced by KDE PIM (Akonadi): %1. Their events are shown once, from the "
"sign-in here, where they can be answered and edited."
msgstr ""
"Ook gesynchroniseerd door KDE PIM (Akonadi): %1. Hun afspraken worden één "
"keer getoond, via de aanmelding hier, waar ze beantwoord en bewerkt kunnen "
"worden."

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Sign In Again"
msgstr "Opnieuw inloggen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
msgid "Reload calendars and task lists"
msgstr "Agenda's en takenlijsten herladen"

#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigGoogleCalendar.qml
#: ../contents/ui/config/ConfigTasks.qml
msgid "Remove Account"
